<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://saranyashalya.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://saranyashalya.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-07-28T09:03:26+00:00</updated><id>https://saranyashalya.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>Senior Data Scientist at Ericsson, building Agentic AI and RAG systems on AWS Bedrock and beyond. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">Knowledge Fabric: AI-Powered Technical Intelligence</title><link href="https://saranyashalya.github.io/blog/2026/knowledge-fabric-ai-powered-technical-intelligence/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Knowledge Fabric: AI-Powered Technical Intelligence"/><published>2026-07-27T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-07-27T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://saranyashalya.github.io/blog/2026/knowledge-fabric-ai-powered-technical-intelligence</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://saranyashalya.github.io/blog/2026/knowledge-fabric-ai-powered-technical-intelligence/"><![CDATA[<style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.kf-page{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:#c9d1d9;line-height:1.6}.kf-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px}.kf-header h1{font-size:2.8em;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#58a6ff,#bc8cff,#f78166);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;margin-bottom:12px}.kf-header .subtitle{font-size:1.2em;color:#8b949e;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto}.problem-solution{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:48px}.kf-card{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:12px;padding:24px}.kf-card h3{font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:12px}.kf-card.problem h3{color:#f85149}.kf-card.solution h3{color:#3fb950}.kf-card ul{list-style:none;padding:0}.kf-card li{padding:6px 0;padding-left:20px;position:relative;font-size:.9em}.kf-card.problem li::before{content:"✗";position:absolute;left:0;color:#f85149}.kf-card.solution li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:#3fb950}.architecture{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:48px}.architecture h2{text-align:center;color:#58a6ff;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:1.4em}.layers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:24px}.layer{background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;text-align:center;position:relative}.layer .num{position:absolute;top:-10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#58a6ff;color:#0d1117;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;font-size:.75em;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.layer .icon{font-size:2em;margin-bottom:8px}.layer .name{font-size:.85em;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3}.layer .desc{font-size:.75em;color:#8b949e;margin-top:4px}.flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;padding:16px;background:#0d1117;border-radius:8px}.flow-step{background:#21262d;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:.8em;text-align:center}.flow-step .step-title{font-weight:600;color:#58a6ff;font-size:.9em}.flow-step .step-desc{color:#8b949e;font-size:.85em}.flow-arrow{color:#484f58;font-size:1.2em}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:48px}.stat{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;text-align:center}.stat .value{font-size:1.8em;font-weight:700;color:#58a6ff}.stat .label{font-size:.75em;color:#8b949e;margin-top:4px}.use-cases{margin-bottom:48px}.use-cases h2{color:#58a6ff;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center}.use-case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.use-case{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;padding:20px}.use-case .emoji{font-size:1.5em;margin-bottom:8px}.use-case h4{color:#e6edf3;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:.95em}.use-case p{color:#8b949e;font-size:.8em}.tech-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;margin-bottom:48px}.tech-col{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:12px;padding:24px}.tech-col h3{color:#bc8cff;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:1em}.tech-items{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.tech-item{background:#21262d;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:16px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:.75em;color:#c9d1d9}.insight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#161b22,#1c2431);border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px}.insight blockquote{font-size:1.3em;font-style:italic;color:#e6edf3;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.5}.insight .attribution{color:#8b949e;margin-top:12px;font-size:.85em}@media(max-width:768px){.problem-solution,.layers,.stats,.use-case-grid,.tech-stack{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.kf-header h1{font-size:2em}.flow{flex-direction:column}.flow-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg)}}</style> <div class="kf-page"> <div class="kf-header"> <h1>Knowledge Fabric</h1> <p class="subtitle">Transform scattered technical documentation into an AI-queryable intelligence layer — connecting features, parameters, dependencies, and metrics into a unified graph.</p> </div> <div class="problem-solution"> <div class="kf-card problem"> <h3>⚠️ Without Knowledge Fabric</h3> <ul> <li>Engineers search 100+ PDFs manually for a single answer</li> <li>Feature conflicts discovered in production, not planning</li> <li>Parameter recommendations scattered across tribal knowledge</li> <li>No visibility into cross-feature dependencies</li> <li>Weeks to onboard new engineers to complex systems</li> <li>Version drift: docs say one thing, reality says another</li> </ul> </div> <div class="kf-card solution"> <h3>✅ With Knowledge Fabric</h3> <ul> <li>Ask in natural language, get cited answers in seconds</li> <li>Conflicts and prerequisites surfaced before activation</li> <li>Per-scenario recommendations with confidence scores</li> <li>Full dependency graph traversal in one click</li> <li>AI agent with domain expertise available 24/7</li> <li>Always current: automated pipeline keeps fabric fresh</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="architecture"> <h2>Multi-Layer Architecture</h2> <div class="layers" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);"> <div class="layer"> <div class="num">1</div> <div class="icon">📄</div> <div class="name">Ingestion</div> <div class="desc">Documents → Markdown → Structured extraction (tables, entities, relations)</div> </div> <div class="layer"> <div class="num">2</div> <div class="icon">🗄️</div> <div class="name">Structured Data</div> <div class="desc">Entity registry, typed metadata, parameters, counters — instant lookup</div> </div> <div class="layer"> <div class="num">3</div> <div class="icon">🕸️</div> <div class="name">Knowledge Graph</div> <div class="desc">Entities + Relationships: dependencies, conflicts, impact paths</div> </div> <div class="layer"> <div class="num">4</div> <div class="icon">🔍</div> <div class="name">Semantic Search</div> <div class="desc">Vector embeddings + lexical search with hybrid ranking fusion</div> </div> <div class="layer"> <div class="num">5</div> <div class="icon">🤖</div> <div class="name">AI Agent</div> <div class="desc">Tool-equipped LLM: routes questions, synthesizes answers, cites sources</div> </div> </div> <div class="flow"> <div class="flow-step"><div class="step-title">Documents</div><div class="step-desc">PDF, HTML, JSON</div></div> <span class="flow-arrow">→</span> <div class="flow-step"><div class="step-title">Parse &amp; Extract</div><div class="step-desc">Tables, entities, relations</div></div> <span class="flow-arrow">→</span> <div class="flow-step"><div class="step-title">Graph + Vectors</div><div class="step-desc">NetworkX + OpenSearch</div></div> <span class="flow-arrow">→</span> <div class="flow-step"><div class="step-title">Entity Registry</div><div class="step-desc">Type resolution &lt;100ms</div></div> <span class="flow-arrow">→</span> <div class="flow-step"><div class="step-title">AI Agent</div><div class="step-desc">16 tools, one round</div></div> <span class="flow-arrow">→</span> <div class="flow-step"><div class="step-title">Answer + Citations</div><div class="step-desc">Traced to source</div></div> </div> </div> <div class="stats"> <div class="stat"><div class="value">&lt;100ms</div><div class="label">Entity Resolution</div></div> <div class="stat"><div class="value">1 Round</div><div class="label">Tool Execution</div></div> <div class="stat"><div class="value">100%</div><div class="label">Cited Answers</div></div> <div class="stat"><div class="value">Multi</div><div class="label">Data Sources</div></div> <div class="stat"><div class="value">24/7</div><div class="label">AI Availability</div></div> </div> <div class="architecture" style="margin-bottom: 48px;"> <h2>How a Question Traverses the Fabric</h2> <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px;"> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #58a6ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 4px;">💬</div> <div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; color: #58a6ff;">User Question</div> <div style="font-size: 0.7em; color: #8b949e;">"Tell me about X"</div> </div> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px;"> <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.75em; color: #bc8cff; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px;">⚡ PARALLEL EXECUTION (dynamic per question)</div> <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px;"> <div style="background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 1.2em;">🏗️</div> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; font-weight: 600; color: #3fb950;">Structured</div> <div style="font-size: 0.65em; color: #8b949e;">Entity lookup<br/>Typed metadata</div> </div> <div style="background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 1.2em;">🕸️</div> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; font-weight: 600; color: #f78166;">Graph</div> <div style="font-size: 0.65em; color: #8b949e;">Relationships<br/>Impact paths</div> </div> <div style="background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 1.2em;">🔮</div> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; font-weight: 600; color: #58a6ff;">Semantic</div> <div style="font-size: 0.65em; color: #8b949e;">Vector search<br/>Cross-doc discovery</div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.7em; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 8px;">Agent selects layers based on question type — not all layers needed for every query</div> </div> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #3fb950; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 4px;">✅</div> <div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; color: #3fb950;">Cited Answer</div> <div style="font-size: 0.7em; color: #8b949e;">Fused from all<br/>activated layers</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="architecture" style="margin-bottom: 48px;"> <h2>Cross-Layer Linking — Why Retrieval is Fast</h2> <p style="text-align: center; color: #8b949e; font-size: 0.85em; margin-bottom: 20px;">Every entity lives in all layers with shared identifiers — one lookup activates the right path through the fabric.</p> <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;"> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #3fb950; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 0.9em; font-weight: 600; color: #3fb950;">Entity Registry</div> <div style="font-size: 0.7em; color: #8b949e;">name → type, class</div> </div> <div style="color: #484f58; font-size: 1.5em;">⟷</div> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #f78166; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 0.9em; font-weight: 600; color: #f78166;">Knowledge Graph</div> <div style="font-size: 0.7em; color: #8b949e;">node → edges, paths</div> </div> <div style="color: #484f58; font-size: 1.5em;">⟷</div> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #58a6ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 0.9em; font-weight: 600; color: #58a6ff;">Vector Index</div> <div style="font-size: 0.7em; color: #8b949e;">embedding → chunks</div> </div> </div> <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;"> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; color: #3fb950;">Registry hit</div> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 4px;">Resolves type in &lt;100ms → skip irrelevant layers entirely</div> </div> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; color: #f78166;">Graph pointer</div> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 4px;">Pre-filtered neighbors → traverse only relevant connections</div> </div> <div style="background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; text-align: center;"> <div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: 600; color: #58a6ff;">Vector scope</div> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 4px;">Targeted similarity search → no brute-force over full corpus</div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.8em; color: #c9d1d9; background: #0d1117; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px;"> <strong style="color: #bc8cff;">Result:</strong> Entity type tells the system <em>which</em> graph nodes to traverse and <em>which</em> vector partitions to search — no scanning, no guessing. </div> </div> <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px;"> <div class="kf-card"> <h3 style="color: #58a6ff; font-size: 0.95em;">🔄 Always Fresh</h3> <p style="font-size: 0.8em; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 8px;">Automated pipeline keeps the fabric current:</p> <div style="font-size: 0.75em; color: #c9d1d9; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.8;"> <span style="color: #3fb950;">Ingest</span> → new docs detected automatically<br/> <span style="color: #3fb950;">Parse</span> → tables, entities, relations extracted<br/> <span style="color: #3fb950;">Enrich</span> → cross-references linked across docs<br/> <span style="color: #3fb950;">Index</span> → graph + vectors updated in minutes </div> </div> <div class="kf-card"> <h3 style="color: #58a6ff; font-size: 0.95em;">🔌 Multiple Access Patterns</h3> <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 2;"> <div><span style="color: #bc8cff; font-weight: 600;">MCP Protocol</span> <span style="color: #8b949e;">— IDE integration (Claude, Copilot)</span></div> <div><span style="color: #bc8cff; font-weight: 600;">Dashboard</span> <span style="color: #8b949e;">— visual exploration + chat</span></div> <div><span style="color: #bc8cff; font-weight: 600;">REST API</span> <span style="color: #8b949e;">— programmatic access for CI/CD</span></div> <div><span style="color: #bc8cff; font-weight: 600;">Agent</span> <span style="color: #8b949e;">— complex multi-step reasoning</span></div> </div> </div> <div class="kf-card"> <h3 style="color: #58a6ff; font-size: 0.95em;">🛡️ Zero Hallucination by Design</h3> <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 2; color: #c9d1d9;"> <div>Every claim traces to a source <span style="color: #3fb950;">[n]</span></div> <div>No citation = assertion deleted</div> <div>Structured data overrides semantic guesses</div> <div>Agent renders tool results — never invents</div> </div> </div> <div class="kf-card"> <h3 style="color: #58a6ff; font-size: 0.95em;">📈 Built to Scale</h3> <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 2; color: #c9d1d9;"> <div>Thousands of documents ingested</div> <div>Millions of graph relationships</div> <div>Sub-second entity resolution</div> <div>Parallel tool execution — one round</div> </div> </div> <div class="kf-card"> <h3 style="color: #58a6ff; font-size: 0.95em;">🏗️ Why Not Off-the-Shelf RAG?</h3> <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 12px; color: #c9d1d9;"> <div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><span style="color: #f85149;">RAG:</span> <span style="color: #8b949e;">retrieves text chunks, hopes LLM figures it out</span></div> <div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><span style="color: #3fb950;">Fabric:</span> <span style="color: #8b949e;">understands structure, traverses relationships, resolves entities</span></div> <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9em; color: #e6edf3;">The difference: <em>"find docs mentioning X"</em> vs <em>"what depends on X, what conflicts with X, what changed in X"</em></div> </div> </div> <div class="kf-card"> <h3 style="color: #58a6ff; font-size: 0.95em;">🔗 Automatic Cross-References</h3> <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 12px; color: #c9d1d9; line-height: 1.8;"> <div>Entity A in Doc 1 mentions Entity B</div> <div style="color: #8b949e;">↓ <em>automatically linked</em></div> <div>Entity B in Doc 2 references Entity C</div> <div style="color: #8b949e;">↓ <em>transitive path emerges</em></div> <div style="margin-top: 6px; color: #3fb950; font-size: 0.9em;">Result: connections no human manually mapped</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="insight"> <blockquote>"The Knowledge Fabric doesn't replace documentation — it makes documentation queryable, connected, and alive. Every answer traces back to a source. Every relationship is computable."</blockquote> <div class="attribution">— The shift from document retrieval to knowledge intelligence</div> </div> <div class="kf-card" style="margin-bottom: 48px;"> <h3 style="color: #f78166; margin-bottom: 16px;">Design Principles</h3> <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px;"> <div style="font-size: 0.85em;"><strong style="color: #58a6ff;">Entity-First Resolution</strong><br/><span style="color: #8b949e;">Every query resolves "what is this?" before "what about it?" — via a &lt;100ms registry lookup.</span></div> <div style="font-size: 0.85em;"><strong style="color: #58a6ff;">One Round, All Parallel</strong><br/><span style="color: #8b949e;">Agent calls all required tools in a single parallel block. Never chains. Never retries.</span></div> <div style="font-size: 0.85em;"><strong style="color: #58a6ff;">Citation-Mandatory</strong><br/><span style="color: #8b949e;">Every factual claim must trace to a tool result. No claim without [n] = hallucination → delete.</span></div> <div style="font-size: 0.85em;"><strong style="color: #58a6ff;">Graph + Semantic Fusion</strong><br/><span style="color: #8b949e;">Structured graph for precision (conflicts, deps). Semantic search for coverage (fuzzy, cross-doc).</span></div> </div> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="genai"/><category term="knowledge-graph"/><category term="rag"/><category term="ai-agent"/><category term="architecture"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Transform scattered technical documentation into an AI-queryable intelligence layer — connecting features, parameters, dependencies, and metrics into a unified graph.]]></summary></entry></feed>